{"root":{"data":{"id":"fc2e496741ec","created":1555986381,"text":"啊哈算法","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkv589irz40","created":1555986400378,"text":"排序","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkv5c85rm80","created":1555986409002,"text":"桶排序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkvor4cnw00","created":1555987930343,"text":"时间复杂度O(m+n)，以空间换时间，只能对数组排序"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btkvqkuuk480","created":1555988073436,"text":"冒泡排序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkvqnd49880","created":1555988078894,"text":"每次比较两个相邻的元素，如果它们的顺序错误就把它们交换。\n每一趟只能确定将一个数归位，n个数排序就需要把n-1个数归位。时间复杂度O(N^2) "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btkvtr4fho80","created":1555988322170,"text":"节约了空间，牺牲了执行效率"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btkvt196gs80","created":1555988265859,"text":"快排","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkvw83x36g0","created":1555988515871,"text":"每一轮处理就是将这一轮对基准数归位，直到所有的数归位；快排设置基准点后，基于二分式的思想，跳跃式将数据进行交换"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btkwaoq45w80","created":1555989649140,"text":"时间复杂度最差O(N^2) "},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"btkwcqm0hv40","created":1555989809974,"text":"栈、队列、链表","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkwina1b4g0","created":1555990272904,"text":"队列","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkwhbmajo00","created":1555990169160,"text":"队列是一种特殊的线性结构，它只允许在队列的首部(head)进行删除操作，这称为“出队”，而在队列的尾部(tail)进行插入操作，这称为“入队”。\n当队列中没有元素时(即 head==tail)，称为空队列\t\t"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btkwhx0ftuo0","created":1555990215728,"text":"“先进先出”(First In First Out，FIFO) "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btkxb8zdi080","created":1555992514346,"text":"栈","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkxc0uh5ew0","created":1555992574999,"text":"栈限定为只能在一端进行插入和删除操作 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btkxc1jlxy80","created":1555992576519,"text":"后进先出的数据结构\t\t"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btkxdm1f8zk0","created":1555992699496,"text":"链表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btkxe7uzjk00","created":1555992746996,"text":"C语言中用指针存储一个内存空间的地址，实现动态分配内存函数malloc"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl0iow0dfk0","created":1556001560850,"text":"枚举","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl0itz6uio0","created":1556001571926,"text":"有序尝试每种可能性","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl0slarg7s0","created":1556002336676,"text":"搜索","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl1l6ix4ag0","created":1556004577078,"text":"图的遍历","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl1lccfzbk0","created":1556004589747,"text":"深度优先","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl1lexz3sg0","created":1556004595403,"text":"广度优先","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl1m95olyw0","created":1556004661173,"text":"最短路径","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2a9vwa880","created":1556006543497,"text":"最短路径算法对比分析","image":"http://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/808071ab0847c953409110794432fbe8297d7ab6","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":92},"expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl2b4rofjc0","created":1556006610724,"text":"树","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2h2z2q3k0","created":1556007077001,"text":"树","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2d7x15w80","created":1556006774305,"text":"概念：任意两个结点键有且只有一条路径的无向图，只要没有回路的通向无向图的就是树 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2bfussr40","created":1556006634856,"text":"特点：不包含回路","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2bvtmqq80","created":1556006669614,"text":"一棵树上任意两个结点有且仅有唯一的一条路径连通"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2c8x265c0","created":1556006698119,"text":"一棵树上如果有n个结点，那么一定恰好有n-1条边"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2ckiyxsg0","created":1556006723389,"text":"一棵树中加一条边将会构成一个回路"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl2dydetl40","created":1556006831892,"text":"结点","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2g5t8m1s0","created":1556007004815,"text":"树上的每个点都是结点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2gkoay800","created":1556007037168,"text":"可以指定特殊结点（没有父结点的结点）作为根，一棵树有且只有一个根结点"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl2ha761uo0","created":1556007092728,"text":"二叉树","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2hnxc7x40","created":1556007122609,"text":"概念：一种特殊的树。二叉树要么为空，要么由根结点、左子树和右子树组成，而左子树和右子树分别是一棵二叉树。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2ikh9k740","created":1556007193471,"text":"特点：每个结点最多有两颗子树（0 <= 子树 <= 2）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2m2dvb540","created":1556007467540,"text":"图例","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2mctjv2g0","created":1556007490256,"text":"二叉树","image":"http://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/6788b6df830e8d5cd6ad79d35d59aaf94cb121e5","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":142}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl2jrictqo0","created":1556007287138,"text":"满二叉树","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2k1ir3n40","created":1556007308930,"text":"二叉树每个内部结点都有两棵子树，或者是所有叶结点都有同样的深度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2kkn42jk0","created":1556007350553,"text":"一棵深度为h且有2^h-1个结点的二叉树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2mo7nvi80","created":1556007515054,"text":"图例"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2mqra9080","created":1556007520594,"text":"满二叉树","image":"http://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/bff75c144cc4483fe996d77a61b764cb17c8cfed","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":139}},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl2lpb78f40","created":1556007439080,"text":"完全二叉树","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2nmrrqts0","created":1556007590280,"text":"一棵二叉树除了最右边位置上有一个或几个叶结点缺少，其他都是丰满"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2ny2wefc0","created":1556007614898,"text":"高度为h的二叉树，除第h层外，其他各层（1～h-1）的结点数都达到最大个数，第h层从右向左连续缺若干结点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl2pbbgo080","created":1556007722078,"text":"图例"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2pcual200","created":1556007725393,"text":"完全二叉树","image":"http://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/01ec6c4e0d8a401da8c293d42269948d5ae7e9bf","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":128}},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl2q4do2kg0","created":1556007785338,"text":"堆——特殊的完全二叉树，一种优先队列","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl2qiik0io0","created":1556007816108,"text":"最小堆","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl3g8v890g0","created":1556009832575,"text":"所有父结点都比子结点要小，符合这样特点的完全二叉树；即最小的数在堆顶"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl3ga7vv480","created":1556009835517,"text":"删除堆顶，新增一个数被放置到堆顶时，如果不符合最小堆的特性，就把这个数向下调整"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl3im0ukk80","created":1556010017942,"text":"原有堆上插入新元素，新增值插入到末尾，根据情况判断新元素是否需要上移，直到满足堆的特性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl3ezlt2f40","created":1556009734050,"text":"最大堆：所有父结点都比子结点要大，符合的完全二叉树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl3oeolxy80","created":1556010472149,"text":"创建堆","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl3ohzua1c0","created":1556010479358,"text":"1. 把n个元素建立一个堆，将n个结点以自顶向下，从左到右的方式从1到n编码，转为完全二叉树。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl3okh0vcg0","created":1556010484751,"text":"2. 从最后一个非叶结点（结点编号为n/2）开始到根结点（结点编号为1），逐个扫描所有结点，\n根据需要将当前结点向下调整，直到以当前结点为根结点的子树符合堆的特性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl3mhc45bs0","created":1556010321195,"text":"堆排序","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl3mlrjq740","created":1556010330836,"text":"先建立最小堆，每次删除顶部元素并将其放入新数组，直到堆为空"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl3qsx4k800","created":1556010659867,"text":"时间复杂度O(NlogN)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"btl3ui0kvhs0","created":1556010949588,"text":"求数列中第k大的数：建立大小为k的最小堆，堆顶就是第k大的数\n求数列中第k小的数：建立大小为k的最大堆，堆顶就是第k小的数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl3rudn4o00","created":1556010741407,"text":"概念：支持插入元素和寻找最大（小）值元素的数据结构称为优先队列。\n若使用普通队列来实现，寻找最大元素（枚举整个队列），插入元素至已排序的数组（移动很多元素），时间复杂度比较高"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"btl3vqb3jhc0","created":1556011046003,"text":"并查集","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"btl3yx9r2080","created":1556011296251,"text":"通过一个一维数组来实现，本质是维护一个森林。刚开始，森林各个点都是孤立的，都是只有一个结点的树。通过一些条件，将这些树合并成一棵大树\n并查集也称为不相交集数据结构"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}